    "helpsection.scheduledemo": "Schedule Demo",
    "helpsection.faq1_question": "How quickly can I set up my AI phone assistant?",
    "helpsection.faq1_answer": "Most businesses are fully active in under 5 minutes. Simply sign up, choose a voice, enter business details, and your assistant will start handling calls immediately.",
    "helpsection.faq2_question": "What happens during the 3-day free trial?",
    "helpsection.faq2_answer": "During your free trial you receive up to 10 test calls, with a maximum of 3 minutes each. You may call from two different phone numbers for testing. All features are available except unlimited calling.",
    "helpsection.faq3_question": "Can the AI handle appointments and bookings?",
    "helpsection.faq3_answer": "Yes. The AI can check calendar availability, schedule appointments, and send confirmations. It integrates with Google Calendar, Outlook, and other popular systems.",
    "helpsection.faq4_question": "How natural does the AI voice sound?",
    "helpsection.faq4_answer": "Our system uses Google technology to deliver highly natural voices. You can choose from multiple personality styles or customize the tone to match your brand.",
    "helpsection.faq5_question": "What if the AI can't handle a specific call?",
    "helpsection.faq5_answer": "The AI recognizes when a call requires a human. It can transfer the call, take detailed messages, or schedule a callback based on your rules.",
    "helpsection.faq6_question": "How much do additional minutes cost?",
    "helpsection.faq6_answer": "Pricing varies by subscription tier, generally between $0.20–$0.80 per minute. Higher tiers receive better discounted rates.",
    "helpsection.faq7_question": "Is my customer data secure?",
    "helpsection.faq7_answer": "Yes. All data and calls are encrypted with bank-grade security. We are fully GDPR compliant and never share customer data externally.",
    "helpsection.faq8_question": "Can I use my existing business phone number?",
    "helpsection.faq8_answer": "Yes. You can forward your existing number to the AI assistant or use the assigned number as your primary business line.", 
